00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:29.840
Duke, my daughter Charlotte
is only 11 years old though.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.850
That's not a problem.

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:37.800
The younger the better, if she is to be my wife.

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.160
My...

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.910
Come, introduce yourself, Charlotte.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.540
This is Duke Roland de Guiche.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.750
He is to be your husband very soon.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:08.330
Well then, did you like my gifts?

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:19.510
Charlotte! Charlotte!

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:20.840
Charlotte! Charlotte!

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:23.370
Charlotte, pull yourself together!

