00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:03.660
episode

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:03.660
"Farewell, Little Sister !"

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:36.270
I didn't realize she had become quite the rider.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.390
Perhaps it's her tenacity...

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:43.200
There's a fire burning in Rosalie for the
sole purpose of avenging her mother.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:46.190
Countess Polignac...

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:50.570
Avenge her mother and then what?

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:53.830
Her fire will burn out and what will she do then?

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:02.810
If there's anything we can do for her,
it'll be afterwards, won't it?

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:04.340
Yeah.

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:19.760
This is my decision as your mother.

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:23.700
I made this decision for the sake of the
Polignac family and for your own benefit.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:26.040
You'll be a duchess.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:29.000
It's a dream come true for a lady.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.270
Furthermore, Lord de Guiche is the Commissioner
of the General Inspection and Finances,

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:34.500
and is highly trusted by His Majesty.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.470
Also, almost all of the land in the
Bourbonnais province belongs to—

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:37.850
Ouch!

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:39.010
Oh, please excuse me!

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:42.720
Lady Charlotte, my apologies.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.150
I didn't realize I was pulling so hard...

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.180
Don't touch me!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.650
Don't touch me... not anyone...

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:52.690
Please...

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.440
Charlotte.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:00.360
No, no, no!

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:05.040
Mother, I don't want to marry!

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.210
It's never even crossed my mind!

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:10.140
And I'm... I'm only 11 years old!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.000
Mother...!

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:16.740
Sooner or later, a woman
must be loved by a man.

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:19.920
That's where a woman's happiness lies.

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:31.000
Now, hurry and raise Charlotte's hair.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.010
Hurry, or we'll be late for the soirée.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:33.900
Y-Yes!

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:33.900
Yes!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:05.590
Rosalie!

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:11.000
What happened? You didn't
go to the soirée with Oscar?

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:16.310
Yes, because if I go to Versailles,
that woman will be there...

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.840
Madame Polignac.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.580
Every time I see her, my hatred for her grows.

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:24.080
Plus, today is my dead mother's birthday.

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:28.200
I don't know what I'd do, if I saw her today.

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:31.950
Good night, Rosalie.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:33.920
Good night, André.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:45.380
Have you heard about Lady Charlotte's engagement?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.640
Yes, with Duke de Guiche.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.850
The Duke is 43 and Lady Charlotte is only...

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:54.020
That's what the Duke prefers, so I hear...

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:54.520
Oh, my...

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:26.810
Anything unusual?

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:27.970
No, all clear.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.020
Commander.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:34.420
Is it all right for you to step out of the party?

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:36.450
Commander!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.540
Lady Oscar!

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:04.050
You mustn't be alone in such a secluded place.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:06.710
My subordinates aren't patrolling this far out.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:09.520
Lady Oscar...

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:14.510
If you wish to be alone,
please go back to your room.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:16.720
Lady Oscar...!

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:19.680
Come, I'll escort you.

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:21.890
L... Lady Oscar!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:30.650
Lady Oscar, I...

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:34.550
I wish I could have grown a little more,
fallen in love, and then...!

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:36.850
And then, become a bride...

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:40.580
...to someone wonderful as you, Lady Oscar...

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.400
Come, let's go. It's getting windy.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:52.230
Um...

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:55.230
Please allow me to have
this rose from your chest!

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:18.890
Oscar!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:20.960
You're late.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:22.300
It's already time to leave for work.

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:23.000
Where have you been?

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:26.460
Where is Rosalie?!

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:29.270
She's probably out riding.
She's not in the manor.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.670
I see. I'm glad to hear that.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.440
I don't want her to hear this yet!

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.420
About what?

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.610
Martine Gabrielle!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.550
Martine Gabrielle?

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:45.020
It's the name Nicole Lamorlière{Moliàre}, the mother who raised her, revealed to her before she died.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.490
It's Rosalie's birth mother's name.

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:48.180
I found out who she is!

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:53.790
During her younger days,
her name was Martine Gabrielle de Goulard.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:57.230
But after she married,
she changed her first name for some reason.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:58.330
Charron!

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.970
She changed Martine Gabrielle to Charron!

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.100
Charron?

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.540
I've heard it somewhere.

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:07.480
Yes, Oscar, you must have heard it.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:10.310
Her current name is Charron de Polignac!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:16.170
The Countess Polignac?!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.520
There's no doubt.

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:19.390
I have an acquaintance at the Royal Library.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:22.520
I learned this after combing through all
the genealogies of the noble families.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:23.890
I see...

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.290
How could this be...!

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:28.260
Rosalie's birth mother is Madame Polignac!

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:35.300
Rosalie.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:41.180
I once promised to you atop this tower
that I would teach you how to use a sword.

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:43.580
I also said I would help you avenge your mother.

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:47.160
Those words I said that day were all lies.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:51.170
I said that because I wanted time
to persuade you against it.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:54.020
How ironic this world is.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:57.130
The killer of the mother who raised you,
turned out to be your birth mother...

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.890
My careless decision to buy some time...

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:03.530
...has ultimately brought eternal
agony upon you, instead.

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:04.770
Agony?

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:06.030
No, Lady Oscar.

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:07.590
I'm not in agony.

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:11.060
Because to me, I only have one mother.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:14.640
Nicole Lamorlière{Moliàre} is my only mother.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:18.650
Even after learning that woman
is my birth mother I feel nothing.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:22.180
Not a sliver of love wells within my heart.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.090
In fact, I hate her all the more.

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:30.210
I'll prove I only have one mother and
that woman is the one who raised me!

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.080
Forward, march!

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:17.540
Right turn, right!

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.510
Spread!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.980
Left canter, left!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.060
Any news?

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.960
No, Rosalie's whereabouts are still unknown.

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:40.400
However, I've learned where
Madame Polignac is going.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:44.800
She's invited to a dinner party
at Duke de Guiche's château.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:45.860
That's it.

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.210
That's what I think, as well.

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:50.800
It's certain Rosalie is following her.

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:01.340
What do you say, Lady Charlotte?

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:06.300
If you'd like, I'll make you a room in this
château right away, even tonight.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.060
Oh, oh! How kindhearted of you.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.220
You took my joke to heart.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.310
Help me, Lady Oscar...

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:50.300
Move as slowly as possible.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.390
Charlotte is already asleep.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.870
Yes, certainly.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.590
Hey, you! Make way!

00:14:11.590 --> 00:14:13.780
What kind of idiot stops their horse
in the middle of the bridge?!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:14.420
Move it!

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:20.880
Both of you, raise your hands and
slowly get down from the carriage!

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:24.170
What's going on?

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.030
What happened?

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:30.040
Lady Polignac!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.840
Lady Charlotte!

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.210
Move! Out of the way!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.630
You're...!

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:52.700
Be quiet!

00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:55.190
Don't talk to me!

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:57.660
It'll be over quickly.

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:01.700
All I need to do is pull the trigger.

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:11.710
I don't want to die!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.210
Don't shoot!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:14.880
Don't shoot me!

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:46.350
There's no way you could shoot her.

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:51.380
A kindhearted girl like you
could never shoot her real mother.

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:56.390
What did you say...?!

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.630
This girl's name is Rosalie Lamorlière{Moliàre}.

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:02.870
That should be enough to make you realize,

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:04.570
Madame Charron de Polignac...

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:07.860
No, Madame Martine Gabrielle de Polignac!

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:13.240
Excuse us.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:26.960
Look, Rosalie.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:32.060
That makes this girl your little sister.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:33.930
Thank goodness.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:38.070
If you had pulled the trigger,
she would have been the one to grieve next.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:41.440
No... She's not my sister!

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:44.080
Because Madame Polignac isn't my mother!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.350
So...

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.770
This girl is a total stranger to me!

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:55.450
<i>That girl... is Rosalie Lamorlière.</i>

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.590
<i>Rosalie Lamorlière{Moliàre}...</i>

00:16:58.590 --> 00:16:59.820
<i>If so...</i>

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.630
<i>She's my child for certain!</i>

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:04.750
<i>The child I bore when I was 15!</i>

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.670
<i>Then, that woman my carriage
ran over that time was...!</i>

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.710
<i>The woman who adopted Rosalie right
after her birth and raised her in my stead...</i>

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:16.570
<i>Nicole Lamorlière{Moliàre}!</i>

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:19.240
<i>How... How could this be?!</i>

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:21.410
<i>Nicole, who was so kind...</i>

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:23.010
<i>Oh, God...!</i>

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:26.380
<i>Am I cursed by the wicked devil...?</i>

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:30.380
<i>Please... Please protect me
from this moment forth...!</i>

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:54.900
Presenting Her Royal Majesty the Queen,
Lady Marie Antoinette!

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:03.550
Presenting Count Hans von Fersen!

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:07.720
Presenting Duchess de Coignies!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:19.870
Rosalie!

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:21.630
I'm surprised you decided to come to the ball.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.040
Yes, to take my mind off of things...

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:26.460
That's good.

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:39.350
Well, well, if it isn't Lady Charlotte.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:46.200
Come in, come in.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.400
B-But—

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:48.130
No, no, no! Please come in.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:54.310
Now, now, what are you so alarmed for?

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:57.240
You and I are to be married soon.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:05.910
I was only going to ask you to allow
me to kiss your adorable little hand.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.680
Now, now, come closer.

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:09.870
Charlotte...

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:09.870
No!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:15.830
Don't mind me.

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:16.790
Excuse me.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:37.810
What's the matter? Say it again!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.590
Yes, we couldn't hear you well!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.280
It's an emergency!

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.560
The daughter of the Polignac family
is standing on top of a tower!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.150
Charlotte!

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:11.320
I washed my hand well.

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:15.040
Now, I can be pure and
beautiful again, like this rose.

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:18.130
I don't want to... marry...

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.050
Charlotte!

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:45.750
Charlotte...

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:52.020
I'm not sad.

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:53.920
We may be linked by blood,

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:56.090
but I've never even lived with her.

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:58.790
We've only spoken once or twice, at that.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.030
We may be connected by blood,
but that alone doesn't harbor love.

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:06.400
Blood relatives can be total strangers, as well.

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:13.220
Isn't that so, Lady Oscar?!

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:19.910
She's dead, Lady Oscar! My little sister...!

00:22:20.820 --> 00:22:23.880
She died without knowing I'm her sister!

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:26.240
Poor girl...

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:29.190
My little sister... She was only 11 years old!

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:33.210
To be continued

